1
00:00:00,026 --> 00:00:03,086
(Penny:)She would clearly like
to have a physical relationship with you.

2
00:00:03,262 --> 00:00:04,632
(Penny:)So, what are you doing?

3
00:00:04,797 --> 00:00:07,887
(Leonard:)All right, we're down the rabbit hole.
What are you doing?

4
00:00:08,901 --> 00:00:11,491
(Sheldon:)Well, first of all, I'm quite fond of Amy.

5
00:00:11,671 --> 00:00:12,971
(Penny:)Then what's the problem?

6
00:00:13,439 --> 00:00:14,909
(Sheldon:)Penny...

7
00:00:15,575 --> 00:00:18,445
(Sheldon:)...all my life I have been uncomfortable...

8
00:00:18,611 --> 00:00:22,101
(Sheldon:)...with the sort of physical contact
that comes easily to others...

9
00:00:22,281 --> 00:00:24,651
(Sheldon:)...handshaking, hugging...

10
00:00:24,817 --> 00:00:26,687
(Sheldon:)...prostate exams.

11
00:00:31,190 --> 00:00:33,090
(Sheldon:)But I'm working on it, you know?

12
00:00:33,259 --> 00:00:37,089
(Sheldon:)Just recently, I had to put VapoRub
on Amy's chest.

13
00:00:37,263 --> 00:00:39,993
(Sheldon:)A year ago,
that would have been unthinkable.

14
00:00:40,166 --> 00:00:43,366
(Leonard:)Now you know how I feel
when I have to put it on you.

15
00:00:45,705 --> 00:00:46,795
(Penny:)Okay, hang on.

16
00:00:46,973 --> 00:00:49,703
(Penny:)Are you saying
someday you and Amy might...

17
00:00:49,876 --> 00:00:52,936
(Penny:)...actually get physical?

18
00:00:56,215 --> 00:01:00,025
(Sheldon:)It's a possibility.

